This code is designed to handle datasets of varying sizes efficiently, without excessive memory overhead, by using memory alignment techniques to enhance cache performance. It also ensures thread safety and efficient resource utilization by implementing a mechanism to process data in parallel using multiple threads, while minimizing contention and maximizing throughput. Additionally, it is designed to scale well with the number of available CPU cores, balancing parallelism with resource contention.

