To ensure efficient memory management, this implementation uses a custom memory pool to allocate and deallocate memory for the records. This allows for better control over memory usage and reduces the risk of memory leaks or fragmentation. Additionally, this implementation uses a mechanism to handle cases where memory allocations fail, ensuring that the function can gracefully degrade without crashing.

